<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Raise Divine</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 0), Healer (guild level 4)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast raise divine &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast raise divine</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's divine ability for about ten minutes, so their divine 
spells work better. The better your protection sphere, the bigger the raise: 
a point or two at first, up to ten points and a little more for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who is already raised, the magic just 
dissipates. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls. For magic power, see <a cmd='#'>Help Raise Magic</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Raise Magic</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Abilities</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>